AiTask qa_e1_email_report {
  label: 'QA E1 scheduled email report'
  description: 'QA test 2026-09-24, delete after test: scheduled email with a chart attachment.'

  brief: @md
Using the Ecommerce Official dataset and its Revenue metric, compute total Revenue for August 2026 and for July 2026 (by order created date), and the percentage change from July to August.

Create a column chart of monthly Revenue from January 2026 to August 2026.

Then send ONE email to nhi.ty@holistics.io with the subject "[QA E1] August vs July 2026 revenue". The email body must be three sentences: August revenue, July revenue, and the percentage change. Attach the monthly revenue chart as a PNG file.
;;

  acceptance_criteria: @md
An email was delivered to nhi.ty@holistics.io with the subject "[QA E1] August vs July 2026 revenue", a three-sentence body stating August 2026 revenue, July 2026 revenue and the percentage change, and the monthly revenue chart attached as a PNG. The delivery outcome is reported.
;;
}
